        {
            "type": "text",
            "size": "H3",
            "content": "The XNOR (or) Exclusive-NOR is a digital Logic gate that gives the output as high (1) when both the inputs are same. The Truth table of XNOR gate which consists of two inputs is given below"
        },
        {
            "type": "widget",
            "sub_type": "table",
            "content": {
                "heading": [
                    "Input 1",
